    # Mutation: Stop instead of SilentlyContinue on the rollback removal or copy -> the first locked entry throws before the rest of the snapshot is copied back, leaving the user with only the locked entry.
    It 'copies the whole snapshot back even when one live UserProfiles entry is locked' {
        $profiles=Join-Path $TestDrive 'legacy-rollback-locked-profiles'
